{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"111753","name":"NH Madrid Las Tablas","description":"The NH Madrid Las Tablas hotel is in a convenient location for both business and leisure travelers. The hotel is 14km north of the city center, close to business parks and the BBVA Financial City, while Madrid's top sites, such as the Museo Nacional Del Prado, are within easy reach via public transport. The Maria Tudor light metro station is 300m from the hotel and an El Corte Inglés department store is also within walking distance. NH Madrid Las Tablas has 149 spacious rooms decorated in soothing brown shades with blue accents. Each room comes with all the necessities such as free Wi-Fi, satellite TV, and a minibar. The breakfast is a delicious affair with many options, including local Spanish specialties. Our in-house restaurant serves scrumptious local and regional cuisine, while guests can also have a drink with a light meal in our bar - a bold and contemporary space to unwind. On warm days, opt for a drink on one of our two outdoor terraces. Guests will be able to invigorate their body at the fitness room. For functions, the hotel has 8 meeting rooms for up to 70 people.","address":"Avenida De Burgos, 131","city":"MADRID","countryCode":"ES","postalCode":"28050","lat":40.498461,"lng":-3.664862,"stars":4,"chain":"NH","giataCode":"124296","phone":"+34917186999","email":"nhlastablas@nh-hotels.com","website":"https://www.nh-hoteles.es/hotel/nh-madrid-las-tablas","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/11/111753/111753a_hb_a_016.jpg?20250404130304?20250622193649","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/11/111753/111753a_hb_a_017.jpg?20250404130304?20250622193649","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/11/111753/111753a_hb_a_018.jpg?20250206080058?20250622193649","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/11/111753/111753a_hb_a_0